                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man maeni en e kawok mir adhurane: I ng’ete ma yor ariwa ma malu bol rubanga ang’wen ku dak abic ku por; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man dhugang’ mir adhurane bibedo calku nying’ mi suru mir Israel, dhugang’ adek yor ariwa ma malu: dhugang’ pa Ruben, acel; dhugang’ pa Yuda, acel; dhugang’ pa Lawi, acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man i ng’ete ma yo nyangu bol rubanga ang’wen ku dak abic, man dhugang’ adek: en e dhugang’ pa Yusuf, acel; dhugang’ pa Benyamin, acel; dhugang’ pa Dan, acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man i ng’ete ma yor ariwa ma piny bol rubanga ang’wen ku dak abic ku por, man dhugang’ adek: dhugang’ pa Simeon, acel; dhugang’ pa Isakar, acel; dhugang’ pa Zebulun, acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ng’ete ma yo reto bol rubanga ang’wen ku dak abic, ku dhugange adek: en e dhugang’ pa Gad, acel; dhugang’ pa Acer, acel; dhugang’ pa Naftali, acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebibedo bol rubanga apar wi abora gbur: man nying adhurane ugambre i ceng’ maeca bibedo kumae, Yehova ni kuca.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.35"
            ]
          }
        }
